py\">Ask Us</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h1 class=\"gh-h gh-h--1 gh-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Questions, answered</span></h1><p class=\"gh-lede gh-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The essentials first. Anything we have not decided yet says so, instead of guessing.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"search\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"search-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Search the site\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"search-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Search the site</span></h2></div><form class=\"gh-form gh-form--search\" role=\"search\" method=\"get\" data-bl-k=\"form\" data-bl-form=\"\"><div class=\"gh-field\"><label class=\"gh-label\" for=\"ask-q\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">What are you looking for?</span></label><p class=\"gh-hint\" id=\"ask-q-hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">For example: valet, kids, Cindy’s, dress code</span></p><input id=\"ask-q\" class=\"gh-input\" aria-describedby=\"ask-q-hint\" type=\"search\" minlength=\"2\" maxlength=\"200\" name=\"q\" value=\"\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"></div><p class=\"gh-form__actions\"><button class=\"gh-btn gh-btn--primary\" type=\"submit\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-dark=\"\"><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Search</span></span></button></p></form></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Frequently asked\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"faq-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Frequently asked</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-faq\" data-bl-b=\"\"><article id=\"when-and-where\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-when-and-where\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"When and where is the wedding?\"><h3 id=\"faq-when-and-where\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">When and where is the wedding?</span></h3><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Saturday, July 17, 2027, at the Chicago Athletic Association Hotel, 12 S Michigan Ave, Chicago, IL 60603.</span><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"what-time\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-what-time\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What time does it start?\"><h3 id=\"faq-what-time\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What time does it start?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding page will show them with the date they were confirmed.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the ceremony, cocktail hour, and reception times are being confirmed with the planner.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/the-wedding\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The Wedding</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"dress-code\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-dress-code\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What should I wear?\"><h3 id=\"faq-dress-code\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What should I wear?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the dress code, in one sentence, with an example outfit.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"kids\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-kids\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can we bring our kids?\"><h3 id=\"faq-kids\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can we bring our kids?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">kid policies and any activities for the 28 children in the family.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"plus-ones\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-plus-ones\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I bring a plus-one?\"><h3 id=\"faq-plus-ones\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I bring a plus-one?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your invitation will say who it covers.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">plus-one wording.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"parking\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-parking\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where do I park?\"><h3 id=\"faq-parking\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where do I park?</span></h3><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel’s valet entrance, parking options, and current rates are kept as dated records on Explore CAA, each with the day we last checked them against the hotel’s own page.</span><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/explore-caa#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"weather\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-weather\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"What if it rains?\"><h3 id=\"faq-weather\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What if it rains?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The ceremony and reception are indoors at the hotel.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">any outdoor plans for the weekend.</span></p></div></div></article><article id=\"photos\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-photos\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Can I take photos?\"><h3 id=\"faq-photos\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Can I take photos?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Two professional photographers and a videographer will be there; the professional galleries arrive after the wedding.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">your photo policy for the ceremony and reception.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/photos\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Photos &amp; Video</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"accessibility\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-accessibility\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Is the venue accessible?\"><h3 id=\"faq-accessibility\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Is the venue accessible?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The hotel describes its accessible rooms and features on its own FAQ page; the link and the date we last checked it are on Explore CAA.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">accessibility details for the ceremony and reception rooms once they are chosen.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/explore-caa#getting-here\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Explore CAA</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"rsvp\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-rsvp\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I RSVP?\"><h3 id=\"faq-rsvp\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I RSVP?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">You’ll receive an invitation link; from there you pick your name and confirm with a one-time code sent to your email. No account, no password.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the RSVP deadline.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/rsvp\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">RSVP</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"travel\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-travel\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Where should I stay, and how do I get there?\"><h3 id=\"faq-travel\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Where should I stay, and how do I get there?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Many of you are travelling in. Travel &amp; Stay will list the hotel block, alternatives, and airports once they are confirmed.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">room-block rate, link, and cutoff.</span></p></div><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/travel\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Travel &amp; Stay</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"gifts\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-gifts\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"Do you have a registry?\"><h3 id=\"faq-gifts\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Do you have a registry?</span></h3><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Your presence is the point. If you’d like to help us with our next adventures, the Gifts page will have the details once we’ve chosen how.</span><p><a class=\"gh-link\" href=\"/gifts\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">See </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Gifts</span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\"> →</span></a></p></div></article><article id=\"contact\" class=\"gh-faq__entry\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-contact\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"article\" data-bl-label=\"How do I reach you?\"><h3 id=\"faq-contact\" class=\"gh-faq__q\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">How do I reach you?</span></h3><ul class=\"gh-flags\" aria-label=\"Status\"><li class=\"gh-badge gh-badge--info\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Details to come</span></li></ul><div class=\"gh-prose gh-faq__a\"><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">the best way for guests to reach you or the planner.</span></p></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"concierge\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"concierge-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Ask a question\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"concierge-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Ask a question</span></h2></div><